[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/375105403","html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/6825#issuecomment-375105403","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/6825","id":375105403,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDM3NTEwNTQwMw==","user":{"login":"sokra","id":1365881,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU4ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1365881?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra","html_url":"https://github.com/sokra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-03-21T21:41:17Z","updated_at":"2018-03-21T21:41:17Z","body":"We need to add a new hook `afterDone`, which is called after the callback.\r\n\r\nThe webpack-dev-middleware can use this hook to figure out when the compilation has finished.\r\n\r\nThe `done` hook is not usable for this, because it's async and it could still take a while until the compilation has really finished.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/375105403/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/401508218","html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/6825#issuecomment-401508218","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/6825","id":401508218,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDQwMTUwODIxOA==","user":{"login":"ghost","id":10137,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwMTM3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/10137?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost","html_url":"https://github.com/ghost","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ghost/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2018-06-30T01:27:10Z","updated_at":"2018-06-30T01:27:10Z","body":"@Alexander-Taran, I could not reproduce the bug. I've run the webpack-dev-server with `--lazy` and lazy loading worked fine for me. Here is the [repo](https://github.com/arkadyt/webpack-lazy).\r\n \r\nI was looking to work on this issue, but I think I am missing something. Could you please provide some guidance on this?\r\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/401508218/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/401636118","html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/6825#issuecomment-401636118","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issue